{"segs": ["PA_cp_5:0.1"], "en": "The Basket of Conduct (Cariyāpiṭaka),", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_5:0.2"], "en": "Chapter on Akitti,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_5:0.3"], "en": "Perfection of Giving (Dānapāramī) 5", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_5:0.4", "PA_cp_5:1.1"], "en": "Furthermore, when I was the chaplain to seven kings,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_5:1.2"], "en": "the Mahāgovinda narrative continues:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_5:1.3", "PA_cp_5:1.4"], "en": "The brahmin Mahāgovinda was honored by kings and gods;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_5:2.1"], "en": "at that time, I [ruled] over seven kingdoms.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_5:2.2"], "en": "With whatever gift was offered to me,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_5:2.3"], "en": "I give this great gift,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_5:2.4"], "en": "unshakeable like the ocean.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_5:3.1"], "en": "I have not given away wealth or grain,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_5:3.2"], "en": "nor do I possess any store of possessions;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_5:3.3"], "en": "yet omniscience is dear to me.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_5:3.4"], "en": "\"Therefore, I give you a boon and wealth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_cp_5:4.1"], "en": "This is the fifth chapter, on the Conduct of Mahāgovinda.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"}
